  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration as a Resource: Mobilization of the Tunisian Diaspora and Stabilization of Disadvantaged Communities in Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the economic development of the disadvantaged regions of the North-West and South-East of Tunisia in order to reduce poverty while decreasing the risks of irregular migration, notably by promoting the active participation of the Tunisian diaspora.</narrative>
  </description>
